# Veyora repository ownership (PRD REPO-015).
#
# Areas below require their named owner's review. The security kernel,
# versioned contracts, release workflows, security model, and the layout
# manifest are specialist-review areas: changes there must not be merged on
# general code review alone (SEC-CRYPTO-011, DOC-002). Until a specialist
# security reviewer is registered for sequence 4, the maintainer account is
# the sole owner and must apply the PRD review gates explicitly.

* @Passion-Flow

# Specialist-review areas (security and release trust).
/packages/security-kernel/        @Passion-Flow
/contracts/              @Passion-Flow
/release/                @Passion-Flow
/repository-layout.toml  @Passion-Flow
/.github/workflows/desktop-release.yml  @Passion-Flow
/.github/workflows/publish-images.yml   @Passion-Flow
/docs/security/          @Passion-Flow

# Area owners.
/apps/        @Passion-Flow
/services/    @Passion-Flow
/packages/    @Passion-Flow
/deploy/      @Passion-Flow
/docs/        @Passion-Flow
/tests/       @Passion-Flow
/tools/       @Passion-Flow
